我先研究这份 ZMMRP 导出的结构，再和 PBIX 里的 Open PO 逐行对 key，确认能对上多少再定方案。

这份导出可以把两列补上：ZMMRP 里的 PO、Item、SLn 拼成的 key 和 Open PO 的 key 格式一致，10,460 行 Open PO 里有 10,011 行（95.7%）能对上。M 和 DAX 我没法在 Power BI 里实跑，逻辑是用 Python 在你这份导出上照着跑过的，第 5 步的验证请务必做。

做法是新建一张表读 ZMMRP 导出，再在 `SQL_Open PO` 上加两个计算列去查它。不动 `SQL_Purc ShNt`，因为另外 4 页还在用它。

这份导出的表头在第 5 行，所有单元格都是带前导空格的文本，列名被截成 10 个字符，日期是 MM/DD/YYYY 文本。所以查询是按列名找列、自己解析日期的，不受电脑区域设置影响。

## 第 1 步：放文件
建一个专门的文件夹，把 ZMMRP 导出放进去。以后每次新导出直接丢进同一个文件夹，查询会自动取最新修改的那个 xlsx。

## 第 2 步：建查询
Transform data > New Source > Blank Query > Advanced Editor，粘贴下面的代码，把查询改名为 `Excel_ZMMRP S4`，然后 Close & Apply。

第一行的路径是我按你 `DMT_Snapshot` 的写法假设的，请改成你实际建的文件夹。

```m
let
    // ===== 1. Folder that holds the ZMMRP exports: change this one line =====
    FolderPath = "\\ap1nas101it0593.file.core.windows.net\sinfile\Data\Procurement\Buyer's Folder\Jiaqi\ZMMRP S4",

    // ===== 2. Take the newest .xlsx in that folder =====
    Files = Folder.Files(FolderPath),
    XlsxFiles = Table.SelectRows(Files, each Text.Lower([Extension]) = ".xlsx" and not Text.StartsWith([Name], "~$")),
    Latest = if Table.IsEmpty(XlsxFiles)
        then error "ZMMRP: no .xlsx file found in " & FolderPath
        else Table.First(Table.Sort(XlsxFiles, {{"Date modified", Order.Descending}})),
    Book = Excel.Workbook(Latest[Content], null, true),
    Raw = Table.SelectRows(Book, each [Kind] = "Sheet"){0}[Data],

    // ===== 3. Find the header row and the columns by name =====
    // The export pads every cell with spaces, puts the header on row 5 and cuts names to 10 characters.
    Clean = (v as any) as text => if v = null then "" else Text.Trim(Text.From(v)),
    AllRows = List.Buffer(Table.ToRows(Raw)),
    HeaderFlags = List.Transform(AllRows, (r) => let c = List.Transform(r, Clean) in List.Contains(c, "Order") and List.Contains(c, "MRP El")),
    HeaderIndex = if List.PositionOf(HeaderFlags, true) < 0
        then error "ZMMRP: header row with Order and MRP El not found"
        else List.PositionOf(HeaderFlags, true),
    Header = List.Transform(AllRows{HeaderIndex}, Clean),
    Col = (name as text) as number =>
        let i = List.PositionOf(List.Transform(Header, each Text.StartsWith(_, name)), true)
        in if i < 0 then error "ZMMRP: column not found: " & name else i,
    iOrder = Col("Order"),
    iItem = Col("Item"),
    iSLn = Col("SLn"),
    iEl = Col("MRP El"),
    iExc = Col("Excep Mssg"),
    iRsch = Col("Rsch dt wo"),
    iTxt = Col("MRP Excep Txt"),

    // ===== 4. Converters (independent of the PC's regional settings) =====
    ToDate = (v as any) as nullable date =>
        if v = null then null
        else if v is date then v
        else if v is datetime then Date.From(v)
        else
            let
                t = Text.Trim(Text.From(v)),
                sep = if Text.Contains(t, "/") then "/" else if Text.Contains(t, ".") then "." else "-",
                p = Text.Split(t, sep)
            in
                if List.Count(p) <> 3 then null
                else try (
                    if Text.Length(p{0}) = 4 then #date(Number.FromText(p{0}), Number.FromText(p{1}), Number.FromText(p{2}))
                    else if sep = "." then #date(Number.FromText(p{2}), Number.FromText(p{1}), Number.FromText(p{0}))
                    else #date(Number.FromText(p{2}), Number.FromText(p{0}), Number.FromText(p{1}))
                ) otherwise null,
    ToKey = (v as any) as nullable text => let t = Clean(v) in if t = "" then null else Text.PadStart(t, 2, "0"),
    ToText = (v as any) as nullable text => let t = Clean(v) in if t = "" then null else t,

    // ===== 5. Keep PO lines (ShNt / Purc) and build the same key as SQL_Open PO =====
    DataRows = List.Skip(AllRows, HeaderIndex + 1),
    Picked = Table.FromRows(
        List.Transform(DataRows, (r) => {Clean(r{iOrder}), Clean(r{iItem}), Clean(r{iSLn}), Clean(r{iEl}), ToKey(r{iExc}), ToDate(r{iRsch}), ToText(r{iTxt})}),
        type table [Order = text, Item = text, SLn = text, MRP El = text, Excep Mssg Key = nullable text, Rsch dt wo GR = nullable date, MRP Excep Txt = nullable text]),
    PORows = Table.SelectRows(Picked, each (Text.Lower([MRP El]) = "shnt" or Text.Lower([MRP El]) = "purc") and [Order] <> "" and [Item] <> "" and [SLn] <> ""),
    WithKey = Table.AddColumn(PORows, "PO_Item_Schd", each Text.TrimStart([Order], "0") & "_" & Text.TrimStart([Item], "0") & "_" & Text.TrimStart([SLn], "0"), type text),

    // ===== 6. One row per PO_Item_Schd: earliest reschedule date first, rows with a message before rows without =====
    Grouped = Table.Group(WithKey, {"PO_Item_Schd"}, {{"Pick", (t) =>
        Table.First(Table.Sort(t, {
            {each if [Rsch dt wo GR] = null then #date(9999, 12, 31) else [Rsch dt wo GR], Order.Ascending},
            {each if [Excep Mssg Key] = null then "99" else [Excep Mssg Key], Order.Ascending}
        })), type record}}),
    Expanded = Table.ExpandRecordColumn(Grouped, "Pick", {"Rsch dt wo GR", "Excep Mssg Key", "MRP Excep Txt", "MRP El"}),
    Typed = Table.TransformColumnTypes(Expanded, {{"PO_Item_Schd", type text}, {"Rsch dt wo GR", type date}, {"Excep Mssg Key", type text}, {"MRP Excep Txt", type text}, {"MRP El", type text}}),
    Result = Table.AddColumn(Typed, "Export File", each Latest[Name], type text)
in
    Result
```

`Export File` 这一列显示当前读的是哪个文件，方便你确认取到了最新的导出。

## 第 3 步：加两个计算列
选中 `SQL_Open PO`，Table tools > New column，分两次粘贴：

```dax
#Rsch dt wo GR = 
LOOKUPVALUE (
    'Excel_ZMMRP S4'[Rsch dt wo GR],
    'Excel_ZMMRP S4'[PO_Item_Schd], 'SQL_Open PO'[PO_Item_Schd.]
)
```

```dax
#Excep Mssg Key = 
LOOKUPVALUE (
    'Excel_ZMMRP S4'[Excep Mssg Key],
    'Excel_ZMMRP S4'[PO_Item_Schd], 'SQL_Open PO'[PO_Item_Schd.]
)
```

如果 `#Rsch dt wo GR` 显示成带时间的，在 Column tools 里把 Format 改成 Short Date。

## 第 4 步：换掉页面上的字段
在 Incoming Details 页：

**下面的 Details 表**
1. 把 `#Rsch dt wo GR` 拖到 Columns 里 Del Date 的下面。如果它变成了 Date Hierarchy（多出 Year、Quarter 几列），点字段的下拉箭头，选 `#Rsch dt wo GR`。
2. 把 `#Excep Mssg Key` 拖到 PO Create Date 的下面。
3. 删掉原来的 Rsch dt wo GR 和 Excp（来自 `SQL_Purc ShNt` 的那两个）。
4. 双击新字段，显示名改回 `Rsch dt wo GR` 和 `Excp`。

**上面的两个 slicer**（它们也连着旧表，不换的话一选就会把表筛空）
1. Rsch Date：把 `#Rsch dt wo GR` 拖进 Field，用 Date Hierarchy，保留 Year、Quarter、Month，删掉 Day，再删掉旧字段。
2. Excp：把 `#Excep Mssg Key` 拖进 Field，删掉旧字段。

## 第 5 步：验证
在 DAX query view 里跑：

```dax
EVALUATE
ROW (
    "ZMMRP rows", COUNTROWS ( 'Excel_ZMMRP S4' ),
    "Open PO rows", COUNTROWS ( 'SQL_Open PO' ),
    "Rsch filled", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( 'SQL_Open PO', NOT ISBLANK ( 'SQL_Open PO'[#Rsch dt wo GR] ) ) ),
    "Excp filled", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( 'SQL_Open PO', 'SQL_Open PO'[#Excep Mssg Key] <> "" ) )
)
```

